        "text": "<thinking> To generate embeddings for a batch of texts, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon Bedrock for this task as it is a managed service that provides access to various foundation models, including those capable of generating embeddings. I will import the necessary SDK and use a specific model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
